# 40-site cluster of Richter & Schulenburg (2010), J2 = 0.5, through layouts of the vector (edc_glayout): ground state,
# first excited level, order parameters.  One H100: 0.22 s per product (2.1 s for the sub engine on the fly).
lattice square a1=6,2 a2=-2,6
couplings J1=1 J2=0.5
sector Sz=0 k=0,0 irrep=A1 flip=+1
solve engine=layout levels=2 device=gpu time_product=1
measure M2 Q=1,1
measure M2 Q=1,0
